      {
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "text": "How many people are coming to the party?",
        "es": "¿Cuánta gente viene a la fiesta?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "text": "About twenty. A lot of them are bringing friends.",
        "es": "Unas veinte. Muchos traen amigos."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "text": "How much food do we need?",
        "es": "¿Cuánta comida necesitamos?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "text": "Not much. We've got a lot of crisps, but only a little cheese.",
        "es": "No mucha. Tenemos muchas papas fritas, pero solo un poco de queso."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "text": "And drinks? How many bottles of water have we got?",
        "es": "¿Y bebidas? ¿Cuántas botellas de agua tenemos?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "text": "Only a few. I'll buy some more. I don't want too much fizzy drink.",
        "es": "Solo unas pocas. Compraré más. No quiero demasiada gaseosa."
      }
    ],
